;; facts.edn — the verifiable source register for Tegucigalpa.
;; One entity per source. Mirrors src/ordinance/facts.cljk (the catalog);
;; scripts/verify-facts.cljk re-fetches every URL here live.
;; Written 2026-09-08 (ingest scout): every URL below was fetched live during
;; this run. See :source/verify for the per-source verification method.
;;
;; Two hosts are cited:
;;
;;   en.wikipedia.org — the founding fact is corroborated by BOTH
;;                      en.wikipedia.org and Wikidata (Q3238) agreeing on
;;                      29 September 1578 with no discrepancy (the two
;;                      preceding municipality entries, Panama City and
;;                      Guatemala City, each had a real date/lineage
;;                      discrepancy that had to be resolved; this one does
;;                      not). Wikipedia is cited as :page-text, so the exact
;;                      sentences read on 2026-09-08 are pinned.
;;   amdc.hn          — the Alcaldía Municipal del Distrito Central official
;;                      portal (organization.edn :official-url). Serves
;;                      UTF-8 HTML and carries the district name both in the
;;                      <title> and 12 times in the de-tagged body
;;                      (measured 2026-09-08). Cited as :page-text.
;;
;; ── WHAT IS NOT CITED HERE, AND WHY (not-cited is NOT absent) ──────────────
;;
;;   www.tsc.gob.hn — Ley de Municipalidades (Decreto 134-90) PDF, the
;;                    primary governing law, kept in the catalog
;;                    (src/ordinance/facts.cljk) as the principal local-act.
;;                    Measured 2026-09-08: curl reaches it (200
;;                    application/pdf, %PDF- magic) and this register's own
;;                    verifier fetched it 3/3 inside a single run, but the
;;                    fleet-growth gate's independent fetch to the same URL
;;                    was refused at connection level on FOUR separate gate
;;                    runs even minutes apart, while the two cited hosts
;;                    answered. A host that intermittently declines an
;;                    automated client is recorded as not-covered, not cited:
;;                    an entry one of the two judges cannot reliably reach
;;                    would make every gate run REFUSE on a coin flip.
;;                    Absence here is not-covered, not a claim that the law
;;                    does not exist.
;;
;;   CEPAL plataformaurbana — Decree 134-90 date 1990-10-29, recorded in
;;                    README.md as secondary corroboration. Its front page is
;;                    a searchable application shell and no stable static URL
;;                    for the specific decree record could be pinned this
;;                    run. Not-cited; not absent.
;;
;; Claims stop at the level actually checked: for the two HTML pages, status
;; + the exact needles read on 2026-09-08. No article text of the Ley is
;; asserted, because none was read (see not-covered).
[{:source/id "ordinance.1578-founding"
  :source/verify :page-text
  :source/url "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tegucigalpa"
  :source/content-type :html
  :page/must-contain ["Tegucigalpa was founded by Spanish settlers"
                      "on September 29, 1578"]
  :ordinance/title "Tegucigalpa was founded as Real de Minas de San Miguel de Tegucigalpa on 29 September 1578 by Spanish settlers"
  :ordinance/number "1578"
  :ordinance/enacted-date "1578-09-29"
  :ordinance/country "HND"
  :ordinance/municipality "tegucigalpa"
  :ordinance/kind :local-act
  :ordinance/url-provenance :wikipedia-wikidata-corroborated
  :ordinance/topic #{:governance}}
 {:source/id "municipal-portal.amdc"
  :source/verify :page-text
  :source/url "https://amdc.hn/"
  :source/content-type :html
  :page/must-contain ["Alcaldía Municipal del Distrito Central"
                      "Distrito Central"]
  :ordinance/title "AMDC — Alcaldía Municipal del Distrito Central, official municipal portal"
  :ordinance/number "portal"
  :ordinance/enacted-date "2026-09-08"
  :ordinance/country "HND"
  :ordinance/municipality "tegucigalpa"
  :ordinance/kind :ordinance
  :ordinance/url-provenance :official-amdc-portal
  :ordinance/topic #{:governance}}]